step	31	-	Quick guide step 31
line	<str>Talk to Grubfoot in the Dorgeshuun Mines, right outside the main entrance to Dorgesh-Kaan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter Dorgesh-Kaan and head north-west to Oldak's laboratory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Zanik in the laboratory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north-west to the temple entrance stairs blocked by two goblin guards.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the guards for Zanik to pass.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head over and talk to the Makeover Mage south-west of Falador using a skills necklace to the crafting guild or a Falador teleport.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick the pharmakos bush outside the building and use the berries on an unfinished toadflax potion to create a goblin potion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Goblin Cave located nearby the Fishing Guild by any means, most commonly a skills necklace to the fishing guild.</str>
line	
line	<str>In front of the goblin guards, drink the goblin potion (pick any goblin appearance).</str>
line	
line	<str>Create a black dye if needed, by using a pestle and mortar on a black mushroom with a vial in inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the entrance.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use black dye on your goblin mail and wear it. Search the crates in the main temple room for a free goblin mail.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the north-eastern room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the crate in the room for a Dorgesh-kaan sphere to free Zanik.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Zanik in the prison cell with a Dorgesh-kaan sphere in inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to the main room, and talk to High Priest Bighead in the northern part of the temple and take the test.</str>
line	
line	<str>Re-enter the north-eastern room where the goblins are wearing black goblin-mail and pickpocket the priest for his Huzamogaarb key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the cave; you can equip a piece of equipment to be thrown out of the cave, then you can teleport.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Aggie in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Acquire a raw slimy eel and head to the Fishing Contest area in Hemenster with a fishing rod.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Catch a whitefish.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Aggie to receive a white goblin mail.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare dyes and return to the Goblin Temple wearing the white goblin mail. Do not teleport out of the temple if your inventory is full or you will lose your goblin mail.</str>
line	
line	<str>Steal the Saragorgak key from the priest in the western room of the temple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Repeat the operation of stealing keys and dying your mail in the following order:</str>
line	
line	<str>Before you leave, unlock the crypt with the six keys to give you more inventory space.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare for a fight</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the crypt (large door north of the temple).</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the "Say-name" option on each of the graves. After defeating them, talk to them.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Ensure you ask <col=800000>Strongbones</col> where Yu'biusk is before leaving.</col>
